   "source": [
    "# Understanding the Drivers of Life Expectancy Across Countries\n",
    "### SDG 3: Good Health and Well-Being\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "**Prepared by:** Juliana Paula T. Binas\n",
    "**Course, Year & Section:** BSIS 3A\n",
    "**Subject:** Analytics Techniques and Tools\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "**Research Question:** What factors influence Life Expectancy across countries?\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook investigates the key drivers of life expectancy using real-world data from the World Bank and Our World in Data. We apply Multiple Linear Regression (OLS) and Robust Regression (RLM) on **z-score standardized variables**, so the coefficients are on a common scale and can be compared directly."
   ]
  },
