   "source": [
    "## Load and Explore the Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset is sourced from the **World Bank Open Data** and **Our World in Data**, merged into a single CSV file containing country-level indicators from 2000 to 2024.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Variables in the Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "| Variable | Role | Description |\n",
    "|---|---|---|\n",
    "| Life Expectancy | Response Variable (Y) | Average number of years a person is expected to live |\n",
    "| Healthcare Spending | Explanatory Variable (X1) | Per capita health expenditure in USD |\n",
    "| Water Access | Explanatory Variable (X2) | Percentage of population with access to clean water |\n",
    "| GDP per Capita | Explanatory Variable (X3) | Gross Domestic Product per person in USD |\n",
    "| CO2 Emissions | Explanatory Variable (X4) | CO2 emissions per capita in metric tons |"
   ]
  },
